    "faq_XwdKmx": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_GkamQw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Clinically Proven Results",
            "content": "<p>LAMIDERM APEX has been shown to help:</p><ul><li><strong>Reduce Wrinkles by 350%*</strong></li><li><strong>Improve Skin Elasticity by 50%*</strong></li><li><strong>Fade Discoloration by 57%*</strong></li><li><strong>Provide Deep Hydration for 72 Hours*</strong></li></ul><p>Experience the future of skincare, powered by innovation and backed by science.</p><p><em>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent disease.</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_aCW7K8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why Your Skin Needs a Renewal",
            "content": "<p>Over time, your skin’s natural repair processes slow down, leading to visible signs of aging. Traditional serums and creams only address surface-level concerns, but they don’t tackle the root cause: <strong>cellular slowdown</strong>.</p><p><strong>LAMIDERM APEX</strong> works differently. It can help:</p><ul><li>Reawaken dormant skin cells.</li><li>Trigger natural collagen production.</li><li>Reactivate your skin’s intelligence system to work as it did when you were younger.</li></ul><p>The result? Skin that looks, feels, and functions better, naturally.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rbjAR8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Use LAMIDERM APEX Smart Serum",
            "content": "<p>Incorporating LAMIDERM APEX into your routine is simple:</p><p><strong>Apply Morning and Night</strong>: After cleansing, pat your skin dry and apply 1-2 pumps on your face, neck, and décolletage evenly. Pat the serum into your skin to help with absorption.</p><p><strong>Follow with Moisturizer</strong>: For best results, pair with a hydrating cream to lock in the benefits.</p><p><strong>See Results in 4 Weeks</strong>: With consistent use, you’ll notice visibly smoother, firmer, and more radiant skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_dGiG9D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Full List of Ingredients",
            "content": "{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}"
          }
        },
        "item_GKixzh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scientific Studies",
            "content": "{{ product.metafields.custom.studies | metafield_tag }}"
          }
        }
      },
